{
  "title": "3rd Jamadi al Akhirah (Martyrdom of Lady Fatimah al-Zahra (s))",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "On the third of Jamadi al-Akhirah, AH 11, Lady Fatimah al-Zahra’(a.s.) departed life. The Shi’ah are thus required to hold consolation ceremonies, visit her, and curse those who wronged her and usurped her right.\n\nAs he mentions that Lady Fatimah al-Zahra’(a.s.) departed life on this day, Sayyid Ibn Tawus, in Iqbal al-A’mal, has mentioned the following form of Ziyarah that is dedicated to her:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا سَيِّدَةَ نِسَاۤءِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا وَالِدَةَ الْحُجَجِ عَلَى النَّاسِ اَجْمَعِيْنَ اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الْمَظْلُوْمَةُ الْمَمْنُوْعَةُ حَقَّهَا اَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰۤى اَمَتِكَ وَ ابْنَةِ نَبِيِّكَ وَ زَوْجَةِ وَصِيِّ نَبِيِّكَ صَلَاةً تُزْلِفُهَا فَوْقَ زُلْفٰى عِبَادِكَ الْمُكَرَّمِيْنَ مِنْ اَهْلِ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَ اَهْلِ الْاَرَضِيْنَ.\nAALSALAAMU A'ALAYKI YAA SAYIDAHA NISAA'I ALA'AALAMIYNA AALSALAAMU A'ALAYKI YAA WAALIDAHA ALHUJAJI A'ALAAA ALNAASI AAJMAA'IYNA AALSALAAMU A'ALAYKI AAYATUHAA ALMAZLUWMAHU ALMAMNUWA'AHU HAQAHAA AALLAAHUMA SALI A'ALAAAA AAMATIKA WA ABNAHI NABIYIKA WA ZAWJAHI WASIYI NABIYIKA SALAAHAN TUZLIFUHAA FAWQA ZULFAAAA A'IBAADIKA ALMUKARAMIYNA MIN AAHLI ALSAMAAWAATI WA AAHLI ALAARADIYNA.\nOn the third of Jumada al-Akhirah, AH 11, Lady Fatimah al-Zahra’ (a.s.) departed life. The Shi’ah are thus required to hold consolation ceremonies, visit her, and curse those who wronged her and usurped her right."
}
